{"_readme":"Roguelike 连战配置(热重载: POST /api/mod-admin/reload_assets;drop_pool/pool_draws 为新逻辑,改代码后需重启服务端才认)。enabled=false 全部旁路。unlock_played_parties: 下发已用队伍时洗掉角色ID(轮数条目保留=folder轮进度不受影响),解除角色锁定实现固定队复用。per_round_drops: 每轮独立奖励槽,type=item|equipment|character；rounds限定轮数，slots/guaranteed_slots定义总槽与必掉槽，chance支持数字或{start,per_round,base_round}逐层曲线，exclude_rounds排除指定层。drop_pool+pool_draws: 每轮从池加权随机抽 N 件(weight 默认1)。drop_character_exp: 掉落角色时同步灌入的经验(0=不灌)。drop_equipment_level: 掉落装备觉醒等级,按件钳制到 equipment_max_level.json 的上限(超上限客户端 C2284 闪退);特殊改造 enhancement 全局不提供(仅29件武器有定义,超限 C2287 闪退)。match_party_element(默认开): 池子按通关队伍的元素过滤(equipment_element.json,-1=通用),魂珠/武器属性不合装不上,过滤空则回退全池。guarantee_weapon(默认开): 每轮第一抽只从武器抽,保底不空军。池=每属性剑+斧各1(max_level=5)+2通用,魂珠同键。show_reward_list_endless: 无尽轮结算是否展示战利品列表(folder 非最终轮永不展示——客户端把非空clear reward当通关庆祝,会把选关列表换成最后一轮导致跳关)。配合 mod-tools/wf_rogue_save.py 生成的空武器存档(player 10 肉鸽空武器)= 独立武器池玩法。;folder_clear_chance:通关折叠奖励概率追加([{type,id,count,chance}]);reset_rerolls_tower:已停用；玩家个人通关或重置只处理个人进度，不触发全服30层关卡重抽;folder_clear_random:通关随机奖励([{pool:[道具id],pick:[min,max]随机选几种(缺省=全选),count:[min,max]每种数量}]),与固定表叠加","enabled":true,"events":{"700099":{"unlock_played_parties":true,"show_reward_list_endless":true,"per_round_drops":[{"type":"item","id":2370099,"count":1,"rounds":[1,1],"slots":1,"guaranteed_slots":1,"additional_reward_group_id":237009900,"additional_reward_index_start":1},{"type":"item","id":2370099,"count":1,"rounds":[2,10],"slots":5,"guaranteed_slots":3,"chance":{"start":0.12,"per_round":0.03,"base_round":2},"additional_reward_group_id":237009900,"additional_reward_index_start":1},{"type":"item","id":2370099,"count":1,"rounds":[11,14],"slots":6,"guaranteed_slots":4,"chance":{"start":0.39,"per_round":0.03,"base_round":11},"additional_reward_group_id":237009900,"additional_reward_index_start":1},{"type":"item","id":2370099,"count":1,"rounds":[15,15],"slots":6,"guaranteed_slots":4,"chance":0.5,"additional_reward_group_id":237009900,"additional_reward_index_start":1},{"type"